TSI device tree sources
=======================

tsi-skylp-chiplet.dtsi
    SkyLP chiplet CSR window + IO-corner pinctrl/GPIO nodes (RAL-sourced).
    A fragment, not a standalone board: it is spliced onto the QEMU tsi-fpga
    machine's synthesized base DTB by the TSISIM deployment
    (tsi_yocto scripts/build_bmc_kernel.sh), which dtc-recompiles the result.
    Requires CONFIG_ARCH_TSI + CONFIG_TSI_CHIPLET + CONFIG_PINCTRL_TSI.
